{"overview":"سری پیش درآمد، سلسله تارگرین‌ها را در اوج قدرت خود می‌بیند، با بیش از 15 اژدها در زیر یوغ خود. اکثر امپراتوری‌ها - واقعی و خیالی - از چنین عظمتی فرو می‌ریزند. در مورد تارگرین‌ها، سقوط آهسته آنها تقریبا 193 سال قبل از وقایع بازی تاج و تخت آغاز می‌شود.","tagline":"آتش و خون.","overview_en":"The Targaryen dynasty is at the absolute apex of its power, with more than 15 dragons under their yoke. Most empires crumble from such heights. In the case of the Targaryens, their slow fall begins when King Viserys breaks with a century of tradition by naming his daughter Rhaenyra heir to the Iron Throne. But when Viserys later fathers a son, the court is shocked when Rhaenyra retains her status as his heir, and seeds of division sow friction across the realm.","tagline_en":"Win or die.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":89,"y":2022,"poster":"/rRk6HhzqhufbsNz6JLK7Kzq1FYm.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل ۱","ep":10,"y":2022,"poster":"/nm4v1YZQA6BMZnrR6xClEi7xXLl.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل ۲","ep":8,"y":2024,"poster":"/5ZO97pt9g7mQn3V2S4qXOcoj4GU.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/7AVT9teYw8O3oXcyB4puCN4Dm8e.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":["George R.R. Martin","رایان کندال"],"crew_en":["George R.R. Martin","Ryan J. Condal"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مت اسمیت","role":"Prince Daemon Targaryen","photo":"/wxMdHj4UA6LgIU5MiA7CKySZeVU.jpg","en":"Matt Smith"},{"name":"اما دارسی","role":"Queen Rhaenyra Targaryen","photo":"/9Zlmb7VmtVCxkLq5yqFFRRxCaED.jpg","en":"Emma D'Arcy"},{"name":"اولیویا کوک","role":"Queen Alicent Hightower","photo":"/wf71ctooNlVmiT8dxx0QmRAzyiX.jpg","en":"Olivia Cooke"},{"name":"جیمز نورتون","role":"Lord Ormund Hightower","photo":"/3i9z9MkUCrlOGdMRw00j2vScxGC.jpg","en":"James Norton"},{"name":"استیو توسان","role":"Lord Corlys 'The Sea Snake' Velaryon","photo":"/9rJafPDkQP8YuLy9iY5v19ZfMIW.jpg","en":"Steve Toussaint"},{"name":"Fabien Frankel","role":"Ser Criston Cole","photo":"/nXh1h7KbdeZc41